graph TD
    A[Heat Stress] --> B[Protein Denaturation]
    B --> C[HSF1 Activation]
    C --> D[HSF1 Trimerization]
    D --> E[HSF1 Phosphorylation]
    E --> F[HSF1 Nuclear Localization]
    F --> G[HSE Binding]
    G --> H[Heat Shock Gene Transcription]
    H --> I[Hsp70 Synthesis]
    I --> J[Protein Folding Assistance]
    J --> K[Heat Shock Response Complete]
    
    %% Alternative pathway
    A --> L[Chaperone Recruitment]
    L --> M[Protein Refolding]
    M --> N[Stress Response]
    N --> K
    
    %% Regulation
    K --> O[Stress Status]
    O --> P{Temperature Normal?}
    P -->|Yes| Q[Response Termination]
    P -->|No| R[Response Continuation]
    
    %% Key proteins
    S[HSF1] --> C
    T[HSE] --> G
    U[Hsp70] --> I
    V[Chaperones] --> J
    W[Heat Shock Proteins] --> K
    X[Protein Folding Factors] --> M
    
